# Character Abilities
ABILITY:Alchemist Discovery|TYPE:NORMAL|CATEGORY:Special Ability|KEY:Discovery ~ Acid Bomb|TYPE:AlchemistClassFeatures.SpecialAttack.AlchemistDiscovery.AlchemistBombModifier|DESC:When the alchemist creates a bomb, he can choose to have it inflict acid damage. Creatures that take a direct hit from an acid bomb take an additional 1d%1 points of acid damage 1 round later.&pipe;AlchemistBombDiceSize
ABILITY:Alchemist Discovery|TYPE:NORMAL|CATEGORY:Special Ability|KEY:Discovery ~ Alchemical Simulacrum|TYPE:SpecialQuality.AlchemistDiscovery.Supernatural|DESC:You gain the ability to create a lesser simulacrum.  This works like the lesser simulacrum spell, except it costs 100 gp in alchemical materials per Hit Die of the simulacrum, requires 24 hours to grow, and decays into inert flesh rather than ice or snow if killed.  The created simulacrum is a creature, not a supernatual effect.
ABILITY:Alchemist Discovery|TYPE:NORMAL|CATEGORY:Special Ability|KEY:Discovery ~ Alchemical Strike|TYPE:AlchemistClassFeatures.SpecialQuality.AlchemistDiscovery|DESC:You gain the Alchemical Strike feat.
ABILITY:Alchemist Discovery|TYPE:NORMAL|CATEGORY:Special Ability|KEY:Discovery ~ Alchemical Zombie|TYPE:SpecialQuality.AlchemistDiscovery.Supernatural|DESC:You gain the ability to animate a relatively complete corpse as an alchemy-powered zombie.  This process takes 1 hour and costs 100 gp in alchemical reagents per HD of the corpse being animated; the dead creature gains the zombie template.  Zombies that are created in this manner count as undead created by Animate Dead for the purposes of determining how many undead the alchemist can control.  The created zombie is a creature, not a supernatural effect.
ABILITY:Alchemist Discovery|TYPE:NORMAL|CATEGORY:Special Ability|KEY:Discovery ~ Augment Creature|TYPE:AlchemistDiscovery.SpecialQuality|DESC:Using a combination of magical and technological methods, the alchemist can grant a corporeal creature the augmented template. The augmented creature owes its creator no special loyalty. The alchemist must be at least 12th level to select this discovery.
ABILITY:Alchemist Discovery|TYPE:NORMAL|CATEGORY:Special Ability|KEY:Discovery ~ Bitter Pill|TYPE:AlchemistClassFeatures.SpecialQuality.AlchemistDiscovery.Supernatural|DESC:The alchemist becomes bitter in flavor. Any creature that hits the bitter alchemist with a bite attack gains the sickened condition for 1 round unless it succeeds at a Fortitude save (DC %1). Any creature that swallows the alchemist whole gains the nauseated condition for 1 round unless it succeeds at a Fortitude save (same DC as above). If the alchemist is trapped in the creature's gullet and it becomes nauseated, the creature vomits him back out immediately as a free action at the start of the creature's turn; the alchemist lands prone adjacent to the creature.&pipe;10+AlchemistDiscoveryLVL/2+CON
ABILITY:Alchemist Discovery|TYPE:NORMAL|CATEGORY:Special Ability|KEY:Discovery ~ Infuse Mutagen|TYPE:AlchemistClassFeatures.SpecialAttack.AlchemistDiscovery.AlchemistMutagenMod
USERPOOL:Alchemist Discovery|POOLPOINTS:0.0
